<title>USA: AT&amp;T in pact for intl high-speed data service.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T in pact for intl high-speed data service.</headline>
<dateline>BASKING RIDGE, N.J. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T said on Tuesday that it signed memoranda of understanding to provide high-speed international private line service to Hong Kong and Taiwan.</p>
<p>The agreements mark the first time such service has been offered to these countries from the United States, AT&amp;T said.</p>
<p>AT&amp;T said its T45 Service lets multinational businesses send large amounts of digital data at speeds up to 45 million bits per second, the equivalent of transmitting the contents of a set of encyclopedias once every 15 seconds.</p>
</text>
